#      a. if no receipt can be found log to trace file, create miscellaneous invoice lines .....
#      b. if no ITMREF found, create miscellaneous invoice line - show in log file with warning flag
#      c. if quantity differ (invoiced quantity vs. received quantity, no need to worry about bo quantity) - show in log file with warning flag after file is created, invoice will be entered as is
#      d. price variance - enter price per invoice, show in log file with warning flag
#      e. in log file show all the expected value vs. what's been imported
#      f. Log to show: Supplier, PO number, Invoice number, Invoice date, Invoice Amount, Tax Amount for the header and then indent for the lines to show issue with each individual line per error
# above
#           Supplier,
